      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Legend:   solid = SDK routing / control flow      dashed orange = control plane writes/assigns      dashed green = data-loader pulls from GCS\nEach pod contains:  [ data-loader (engine-agnostic) + engine (RocksDB pluggable) + read server (TCP) ]      .      Tenants share Control Plane + Producer + GCS; per-tenant data plane is isolated.",
